<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Drip Campaigns &bull; ZapConnect</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/favinco.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/drips.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="page-glow page-glow-a"></div>
    <div class="page-glow page-glow-b"></div>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <a href="/painel" class="hero-back">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
          Voltar ao painel
        </a>

        <h1>Cad&ecirc;ncias que acompanham o lead sem opera&ccedil;&atilde;o manual.</h1>
        <p>
          Monte sequ&ecirc;ncias p&oacute;s-cadastro, p&oacute;s-compra ou por mudan&ccedil;a de etapa no CRM.
          O sistema inscreve o contato sozinho e executa cada passo no tempo certo.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-highlights">
          <article class="hero-highlight">
            <span>Campanha em foco</span>
            <strong id="hero-selected-campaign">Nova campanha</strong>
            <small id="hero-selected-foot">Nenhuma campanha selecionada ainda.</small>
          </article>

          <article class="hero-highlight">
            <span>Janela total</span>
            <strong id="hero-window-total">0min</strong>
            <small id="hero-window-foot">Tempo at&eacute; o &uacute;ltimo passo do editor.</small>
          </article>

          <article class="hero-highlight">
            <span>Enrollments agora</span>
            <strong id="hero-active-enrollments">0</strong>
            <small id="hero-enrollment-foot">Sem leads em andamento.</small>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-panel">
        <div class="hero-panel-top">
          <div class="plan-chip">
            <span>Plano atual</span>
            <strong id="plan-name"><%= String(dripBootstrap?.access?.plan || user?.plan || 'free').toUpperCase() %></strong>
          </div>

          <div class="capability-pills">
            <span class="status-pill" id="usage-pill">Capacidade</span>
            <span class="status-pill" id="sessions-pill">Sess&otilde;es</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="usage-card">
          <div class="usage-head">
            <div>
              <span>Enrollments no m&ecirc;s</span>
              <strong id="usage-counter">--</strong>
            </div>
            <strong class="usage-percent" id="usage-percent">--</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="usage-track">
            <div id="usage-bar" class="usage-bar"></div>
          </div>

          <div id="usage-foot" class="usage-subtle">Carregando limite do plano...</div>

          <div class="usage-meta">
            <article class="usage-meta-card">
              <span>Campanhas ativas</span>
              <strong id="usage-active-campaigns">0</strong>
            </article>
            <article class="usage-meta-card">
              <span>Sess&otilde;es conectadas</span>
              <strong id="usage-connected-sessions">0</strong>
            </article>
            <article class="usage-meta-card">
              <span>Limite do plano</span>
              <strong id="usage-limit-label">--</strong>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="upgrade-banner" class="upgrade-banner">
          <div>
            <strong>Plano Pro libera hist&oacute;rico sem teto mensal.</strong>
            <p>Starter e Free usam limite mensal de enrollments ativos no funil.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/checkout" class="btn btn-inline">Fazer upgrade</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button id="create-new-btn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            Nova campanha
          </button>
          <button id="reload-btn" class="btn btn-secondary" type="button">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i>
            Atualizar
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="stats-grid">
      <article class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon stat-icon-blue">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-body">
          <span class="stat-label">Campanhas configuradas</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="stat-campaigns">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-foot" id="stat-campaigns-foot">Nenhum funil criado ainda</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stat-card stat-card-accent">
        <div class="stat-icon stat-icon-mint">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-clock"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-body">
          <span class="stat-label">Enrollments ativos</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="stat-active-enrollments">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-foot" id="stat-active-foot">Sem leads em andamento</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon stat-icon-amber">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-flag-checkered"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-body">
          <span class="stat-label">Fluxos conclu&iacute;dos</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="stat-completed">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-foot" id="stat-completed-foot">Sem hist&oacute;rico conclu&iacute;do</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon stat-icon-rose">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-body">
          <span class="stat-label">Falhas recentes</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="stat-failed">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-foot" id="stat-failed-foot">Nenhuma falha relevante</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <main class="content-grid">
      <section class="card editor-card span-two">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <span class="card-kicker">Editor visual</span>
            <h2>Monte a sequ&ecirc;ncia do funil</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="badge" id="editor-badge">Nova campanha</span>
        </div>

        <p class="editor-note">
          Cada atraso &eacute; relativo ao passo anterior. Exemplo: mensagem imediata, depois de 1h, depois de 24h.
        </p>

        <div id="editor-overview" class="editor-overview"></div>

        <div class="editor-grid">
          <label class="field field-wide">
            <span>Nome da campanha</span>
            <input id="campaign-name" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="Ex: Sequ&ecirc;ncia p&oacute;s-cadastro" />
          </label>

          <label class="field">
            <span>Gatilho no CRM</span>
            <select id="trigger-stage"></select>
          </label>

          <label class="field">
            <span>Sess&atilde;o preferencial</span>
            <select id="preferred-session"></select>
          </label>

          <div class="toggle-field field-wide">
            <span>Status</span>
            <div id="campaign-active-shell" class="toggle-shell">
              <div class="toggle-copy">
                <strong id="campaign-active-label">Campanha ativa</strong>
                <small id="campaign-active-copy">Leads que entrarem no gatilho ser&atilde;o inscritos automaticamente.</small>
              </div>
              <label class="switch">
                <input id="campaign-active" type="checkbox" checked />
                <span class="slider"></span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-divider">
          <h3>Passos da automa&ccedil;&atilde;o</h3>
          <button id="add-step-btn" class="btn btn-ghost" type="button">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
            Adicionar passo
          </button>
        </div>

        <div id="steps-container" class="steps-list"></div>

        <div class="editor-actions">
          <span id="editor-status" class="editor-status">Pronto para criar uma nova automa&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span>
          <div class="hero-actions hero-actions-compact">
            <button id="delete-btn" class="btn btn-danger" type="button" disabled>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i>
              Excluir
            </button>
            <button id="save-btn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i>
              Salvar campanha
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="card selection-card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <span class="card-kicker">Opera&ccedil;&atilde;o</span>
            <h2>Campanha em foco</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="selection-summary" class="selection-summary"></div>
        <div id="selection-health" class="selection-health"></div>
      </aside>

      <section class="card preview-card span-two">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <span class="card-kicker">Orquestra&ccedil;&atilde;o</span>
            <h2>Preview da sequ&ecirc;ncia</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="metrics-grid" class="metrics-grid"></div>
        <div id="timeline-preview" class="timeline-list"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card campaign-card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <span class="card-kicker">Campanhas</span>
            <h2>Funis salvos</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="campaign-list" class="campaign-list"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card enrollment-card span-full">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <span class="card-kicker">Enrollments</span>
            <h2>Leads em andamento</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="enrollment-summary" class="enrollment-summary"></div>
        <div id="enrollment-list" class="enrollment-list"></div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    window.__DRIP_BOOTSTRAP__ = <%- JSON.stringify(dripBootstrap || {}) %>;
    window.__DRIP_USER__ = <%- JSON.stringify({
      id: user?.id,
      name: user?.name,
      plan: user?.plan,
    }) %>;
  </script>
  <script src="/js/toast.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/drips.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
